---
import {stops,locations,stopURL} from '../lib/catalog';
---
<section><h2>The seven-stop directory</h2><p>Every chapter can be read at home. The former decorative street grid and guessed pins have been removed. Locations without checked coordinates remain unplaced; an address does not establish an exact historical event footprint.</p>
 <ol class="location-list">{stops.map(s=>{const l=locations.find(l=>l.id===s.locationId);if(!l)return null;return <li id={`location-${l.id}`} class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Stop {s.order} · {l.role}</p><h3><a href={stopURL(s.id)}>{s.title}</a></h3><p><strong>{l.historicalName}</strong><br/>{l.address}</p><p>{s.synopsis}</p><p>Position: <strong>{l.precision}</strong> · Condition: <strong>{l.condition}</strong> · Access: <strong>{l.access}</strong></p><p>{l.qualification}</p>{l.currentCheck&&<p class="muted">Address/access note checked {l.currentCheck.date}: {l.currentCheck.note} <a href={l.currentCheck.url}>Current venue source</a></p>}<p><a href={`/sources/#source-${l.supportingSourceId}`}>Historical source {l.supportingSourceId}</a> — {l.supportingLocator}</p><p class="muted" data-visited-stop={s.id} data-js-control hidden></p></li>})}</ol>
</section>
